{"ticker":"544467","symbol":"544467","instrumentId":3197032,"name":"National Securities","industry":"BSE-Financial Svcs-Specialty","about":"NSDL operates as a central securities depository, facilitating the electronic holding and transfer of securities in India’s capital markets. It provides a secure and cost-efficient platform that replaces traditional paper-based settlements. Using advanced technology, NSDL supports investors, brokers, custodians, and issuers via a wide network of Depository Partners across the country. It enables smooth and risk-free transfers of securities through demat accounts, much like bank accounts for funds. By minimizing paperwork, reducing settlement risks, and lowering transaction costs, NSDL plays a key role in improving market efficiency and supporting the evolving needs of India’s financial ecosystem.","website":"www.nsdl.co.in","location":null,"exchange":"BSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:43:14.637Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":797.9,"changePct":-1.7001355180485485,"week52High":1153.95,"week52Low":699.8},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹15,958 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹1,880 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"200,000,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"99"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"92,848,816"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.50%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"6.73"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.8"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.13"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.97"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"43%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"39.88"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"42–77"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"16.0%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"35.67"},{"label":"Volume","value":"374,804"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"449,454"},{"label":"Master score","value":"47"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"30"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"43"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"62"},{"label":"Acc/Dis